<title>USA: ISB Financial sets 5 pct stock buyback.</title>
<headline>ISB Financial sets 5 pct stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NEW IBERIA, La. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>ISB Financial Corp said on Friday its board authorized the repurchase of up to 314,741 shares, or about five percent of the company's outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it would make purchases in the open market during the next months depending on conditions. Purchases were expected to begin on or after January 6.</p>
<p>The repurchased shares will be held as treasury stock and will be available for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
